  "discussion": {
    "headline": "\"dog days\" of summer live up to their name through the weekend",
    "dateLine": "12:15 p.m. Tuesday, August 4, 2026",
    "excerpt": "Due primarily to warm nights and the record-breaking, early-month heatwave, aggregate temperatures in July 2026 ended up about 2.5°F above average at Millersville University (see below). Monthly rainfall amounts varied greatly from county-to-county and neighborhood-to-neighborhood thanks to frequent bouts of scattered, hit-or-miss thunderstorms. …",
